# Commit and Push Gate

- Do not commit until there have been 3 consecutive clean reviews from Cursor subagents running in `yolo` mode.
- If any review is non-clean, reset the clean-review streak and re-review after fixing the issues.
- Only treat a review as clean when the reviewer found no real problems, or any remaining findings are clearly false positives or explicitly accepted follow-ups.
- Do not push unless the commit is ready, the 3 consecutive clean reviews have passed, tests and browser checks are clean, and the user has explicitly asked to push.
- If the user has not explicitly asked to push, never push.
